===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{topics|en|Organ systems}} An [[organ]] system that [[coordinate]]s the activities of muscles, [[monitor]]s organs, [[construct]]s and [[process]]es data received from the senses{{,}} and [[initiate]]s actions.
#: {{syn|en|systema nervosum}}
#: {{mero|en|brain|brainstem|ganglion|nerve|spinal cord}}

